<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">Filipi</book>
  <para style="h">Filipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Filipi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filipi</para>
  <para style="mt">Filipi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu Kri ih tamna, Pawl hoi Timote mah Philipi vangpui ah kaom Kri Jesu ah kaciim kamimnawk, Kricaa zaehoikungnawk hoi kacoehtanawk khaeah ca tarik:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />aicae Ampa Sithaw hoi Angraeng Jesu Kri khae hoi ih tahmenhaih hoi monghaih nangcae khaeah om nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangcae ka poek kruek Sithaw khaeah kawnhaih lawk ka thuih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />lawk ka thuih kruek nangcae boih han anghoehaih hoiah ka thuih toepsoep,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />amtong tangsuek na hoi vaihi khoek to tamthanglok hoih thuih naah na thum o thai pongah ni to tiah lawk ka thuih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nangcae khaeah kahoih toksak amtong Sithaw nuiah palunghaenghaih ka tawn ai, anih loe Jesu Kri ih ani phak karoek to koep ah toksah tih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />hae tiah nangcae boih taham ka poekhaih loe amsoem kalang mue ka tih, ka palung thungah nangcae poekhaih oh pongah, sumqui hoi pathlet ah ka oh; tamthanglok to ka pakaa moe, kacakah kang doet haih, nangcae loe ka hnuk ih tahmenhaih qawktoep kami ah ni na oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu Kri amlunghaih rang hoiah kawkruk maw nangcae hnuk han ka koeh, tito Sithaw mah panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Panoekhaih hoi pathlaengthaihaih to tawnh moe, amlunghaih bangah na pung o aep aep hanah lawk ka thuih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />to tiah ni Kri ih ani pha ai karoek to kahoih koek, coek koi kaom ai, kaciim hmuen ah na om o thai tih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu Kri rang hoiah kaom toenghaih thingthai hoiah na koi o ueloe, Sithaw lensawkhaih hoi pakoehhaih to om tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, Kai khae kaom hmuennawk loe, tamthanglok hoih to pakaahaih om ai ah qoengsak tahang han oh, tiah nangcae panoeksak han ka koeh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kri pongah sumqui hoi ang pathlet o haih loe, Rom misatuh kaminawk khue mah na ai, ahmuen kruekah kaom kaminawk mah doeh panoek o boeh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />sumqui hoi pathlethaih ka tong pongah, Angraeng ah kaom nawkamyanawk loe tanghaih bangah thazok o ai, misahoih o parai, zithaih tawn ai ah tamthanglok hoih to taphong o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thoemto kaminawk loe uthaih, angaek koehhaih hoiah Kri tamthanglok to thuih o; thoemto kaminawk mah loe poek hoihhaih hoiah thuih o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />thoemto kaminawk mah loe kai sumqui hoi pathlet ah ka oh naah, patang ka khanghaih thap aep han a koeh o pongah, poekciimhaih hoi na ai ah, angaek koehhaih palung hoiah ni Kri kawng to thuih o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />toe kai loe kahoih tamthanglok to angdoet haih hanah tokpaek ih kami ah ka oh, tiah panoek o pongah, kalah kaminawk mah loe amlunghaih hoiah taphong o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />to tiah nahaeloe kawbangmaw om tih? Angsak cophaih hoiah maw tamthanglok to a thuih o, to tih ai boeh loe loktang hoiah, kawbaktih loklam hoiah a thuih o cadoeh, Kri tamthanglok ni a thuih o, to pongah vaihi anghoehaih ka tawnh, ue, hmabangah doeh kang hoe han vop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lawk na thuih o haih hoiah, Jesu Kri ih Muithla praekhaih rang hoiah, hae hmuen hae kai loihhhaih ah angcoeng lat tih, tiah ka panoek:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />kai loe natuek naah doeh azathaih ka tongh mak ai, misahoihaih hoiah ni ka koi poe, to pongah ka hing cadoeh, ka duek cadoeh, ka takpum ah Kri lensawkhaih vaihi amtueng tih, tiah kating ai oephaih ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kai hanah loe, hing hae Kri han ih ni, ka duek cadoeh atho oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toe timaw ka qoih han ka panoek ai; taksa ah ka hing vop nahaeloe, ka toksakhaih thingthai hnuk hanah ni ka hing han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />To karai parai hmuen hnetto salakah ka oh sut, Kri hoi nawnto oh hanah, duek han ka koeh halat boeh; to tiah oh han hoih kue:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />toe taksa ah ka oh nahaeloe nangcae han atho om kue tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na qoeng o tahang moe, tanghaih bangah anghoehaih na tawnh o thai han angai vop, tiah ka panoek; to pongah nangcae boih hoi nawnto ka om vop tih, tiah oephaih ka tawnh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />nangcae khae kang zoh lethaih mah, Jesu Kri ah kai nang hoe o haih aep tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangcae khaeah kang zoh cadoeh, kang zo ai cadoeh, poek maeto amhonghaih hoiah nang doet o moe, kahoih tamthanglok tanghaih bangah, nawnto tha pathok o, tiah nangcae ih tamthang ka thaih thai hanah, kho na sak o haih tuinuen loe Kri tamthanglok hoi adue han oh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />na misanawk zithaih tawn ai ah kho na sak o haih mah, nihcae loe anghmaa angtaa o tih, tito amtuengsak boeh, toe nangcae loe Sithaw rang hoiah pahlonghaih na hnu o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Anih tang han ih khue na ai, Anih pongah Kri zuengah patangkhang han ih doeh, nangcae hanah tahamhoih to paek boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Patang ka khanghaih na hnuk o moe, vaihi na thaih o baktih toengah, nangcae doeh na tong o toeng.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To pongah nangcae mah Kri ah monghaih, amlunghaih, Muithla angkomhaih, tahmenhaih hoi palungnathaih na tawn o nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />poek amkhraeng ai, maeto hoi maeto amlunghaih, poek anghmonghaih, poek maeto ah amhonghaih hoiah kang hoehaih koep o sak ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Angzoeh koehhaih palungthin, atho kaom ai ahmin amthang koehhaih palungthin hoiah tih hmuen doeh sah o hmah; kai pongah minawk to hoih kue, tiah poekhaih palungthin to tawn oh loe, maeto hoi maeto khingya oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aimah taham khue khen ai ah, minawk taham doeh poek oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kri Jesu ah kaom poekhaih palungthin to nangcae khaeah doeh om toeng nasoe:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anih loe Sithaw hoi anghmong, toe Anih loe Sithaw hoi kangvan ah om ai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />toe Anih loe angmah hoi angmah ahmin amthang han sah ai, tamna maeto angdoethaih ahmuen ah angdoet moe, kaminawk hoi kanghmong ah ni oh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />kami maeto baktih toengah a oh, duek khoek to lok tahngaih moe, thinglam pongah duek khoek to, tamna baktiah poek pahnaemhaih a tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />To pongah Sithaw mah doeh anih to kasang ah pakoeh moe, ahmin boih pong kasang koek ahmin to paek:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />van ah kaom hmuennawk boih, long ah kaom hmuennawk boih, long thungah kaom hmuennawk boih mah, Jesu ih ahmin khingyahaih paek hanah khokkhu cangkrawn o ueloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ampa Sithaw lensawkhaih amtueng o sak hanah, Jesu Kri loe Angraeng ni, tiah kami boih mah pakha hoi taphong o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />To pongah palung ih kaminawk, ka hma ah lok na tahngaih o baktih toengah, ka om ai naah doeh lok tahngai oh loe, zithaih hoi tasoeh takuenhaih hoiah nangmacae pahlonghaih tok to sah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sak han na koeh o moe, na sak o hmaek thai hanah, nangcae thungah toksahkung loe Sithaw ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na sak o ih hmuen boih ah laisaephaih hoi angaekhaih om ai ah sah oh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />to tiah ni coek koi kaom ai kami, minawk raihaih paek ai kami, poeksae kami hoi lam amkhraeng acaeng kaminawk salakah, zaehaih tawn ai Sithaw caa ah na om o tih, nihcae salakah long aanghaih kapaek ni, khrah hoi cakaehnawk baktiah na aang o thai tih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />to tiah hinghaih lok na patawnh o poe nahaeloe, kai loe tidoeh avang ai ah cawn kami na ai, atho kaom ai ah toksah kami doeh na ai, Kri ih ani phak naah anghoehaih hoiah ka om thai tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ue, kai loe na tang o haih bangah toksak haih hoi angbawn haih ah paek ih hmuen baktiah ka oh langlacadoeh, oephaih ka tawnh, kai loe nangcae boih hoi nawnto anghoehaih ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangcae doeh kai baktiah nang hoe o ueloe, kai hoi nawnto nang hoe o toeng tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangcae ih tamthang ka thaih moe, monghaih ka tawnh thai hanah, nangcae khaeah Timote kang patoeh palang thai tih, tiah Angraeng Jesu ah oephaih ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anih baktiah palung tang hoi nangcae khetzawn kakoeh, kami maeto doeh ka tawn ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kami boih mah Kri Jesu koehhaih to pakrong o ai, angmacae koehhaih to ni pakrong o boih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Capa hoi ampa nawnto toksak hoi baktih toengah, Timote loe kai hoi nawnto kahoih tamthanglok to ka thuih hoi, tito a sak ih hmuen rang hoiah na panoek o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />To pongah kai khaeah tih hmuen maw om tih, tito ka panoek naah, anih to nangcae khaeah kang patoeh palang thai tih hmang, tiah oephaih ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Angraeng rang hoiah kai doeh akra ai ah nangcae khaeah kang zo thai tih, tiah oephaih ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toe kam nawk, tok nawnto ka sak haih ampui, misa nawnto ka tuk haih ampui, nangcae ih laicaeh ah kaom, kai khenzawnkung, Epaphrodita to nangcae khaeah kang patoeh han angaih, tiah ka poek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Anih mah nangcae paroeai poek, anih ngannat ti, tiah na thaih o pongah, anih loe palungset.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anih loe duek duih khoek to ngannat; toe Sithaw palungnathaih a nuiah oh; anih khue ai, palungsethaih to palungsethaih hoi thap aep han ai ah, ka nuiah doeh Sithaw palungnathaih oh toeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />To pongah Epaphrodita na hnuk o let naah, nang hoe o thai moe, palung ka sethaih hoih khang hanah, anih ka patoeh han ka koeh aep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />To pongah anih to Angraeng ah anghoehaih palungthin hoiah talawk oh; to baktih kaminawk to khingya oh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />anih loe duek duih khoek to Kri ih tok to a sak, anih loe angmah hinghaih to poek ai, kai han nang paek o thai ai ih hmuen to paek hanah tok a sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, hnukkhuem koekah, Angraeng ah anghoe oh. Tarik tangcae tarik let han ka paqak ai, nangcae atho ohhaih ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Uinawk to ayae oh, kahoih ai hmuen sah kaminawk to ayae oh, tangzat hin aat baktiah angsah kaminawk to ayae oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aicae loe loktang ah tangzat hin aat kami ah ni a oh o, palungthin hoiah Sithaw a bok o moe, taksa oephaih tawn ai, Kri Jesu ah anghoe kami ah ni a oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toe kai doeh taksa ah amoek han koi ka tawnh toeng, kalah kami maeto mah taksa amoek han tawn nahaeloe, kai taoe cae loe nihcae pongah amoek han ka tawnh aep:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />kai loe ni tazetto niah tangzat hin ka aah, Israel acaeng, Benzamin ih atii ah ka oh, Hebru kaminawk thungah Hebru tangtang ah ka oh; kaalok baktiah khet nahaeloe, Farasi kami maeto ah ka oh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tha pathokhaih bangah khet nahaeloe, Kricaabu pacaekthlaek kami ah ka oh; kaalok pazuihaih rang hoiah toenghaih bangah khet nahaeloe, coek koi tawn ai kami ah ka oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toe Kri pongah kai han atho kaom hmuennawk to ka pathlong boih boeh, tiah ka poek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />To khue ai, kahoih koek ka Angraeng Kri Jesu to ka panoek pongah, hmuennawk boih ka sung boeh, tiah ka poek: anih pongah hmuennawk boih ka sung boeh, Kri ka tawnh thai hanah, to hmuennawk loe aek baktiah ah ni ka poek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anih ka hnuk thai hanah, kaalok hoiah kaom, kaimah ih toenghaih to oep ai ah, Kri tanghaih rang hoiah kaom toenghaih, Sithaw toenghaih to ni ka oep:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />thacak anih angthawk lethaih hoi anih patangkhanghaih ah athum moe, anih ka panoek thai hanah, anih duekhaih ah ka duek toeng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />to tiah ni, kai doeh duekhaih thung hoi angthawk let thai toeng tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka hak boeh moe, angaihaih om ai ah, ka koep boeh, tiah ka thui ai: toe to hmuen to naeh thai hanah a hnukah ka patom, to tih han ih ni Kri Jesu mah kai ang patawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, hae hmuen hae ka panoek boih boeh, tiah ka poek ai: toe ka sak ih hmuen maeto oh, kalaem tangcae hmuennawk to ka caehtaak moe, hmabang kaom hmuennawk to ka patom,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kri Jesu ah kasang kawkhaih Sithaw ih tangqum hnuk hanah, hmabangah ka cawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />To pongah Muithla bangah qoeng khuek kaminawk loe, hae baktih palungthin hae tawn o si: toe poekhaih dan kalah na tawnh o nahaeloe, Sithaw mah hae hmuen kawng hae nangcae han kamtuengah panoeksak tih, tiah ka poek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toe aicae loe a hnuk o tangcae hmuen baktih toengah poekhaih maeto hoiah caeh o poe si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, ka sak ih hmuen sah pazui kami ah om oh, nangcae han khet koi kaom ah ka sak o ih hmuen sah pazui kaminawk khae hoiah amtuk oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />(Kang thuih o toepsoep, vaihi doeh mikkhraetui krakhaih hoiah kang thuih o; nihcae loe Kri thinglam ih misa ah oh o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />nihcae loe amrohaih hoiah ni boeng o, angmacae ih zok to sithaw ah a bok o; azat kaom a sak o ih hmuen to lensawk hmuen baktiah amoek o haih, nihcae loe long hmuen nuiah poekhaih a suek o.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toe aicae loe van ah ohhaih kawng to ni a thuih o; to pongah van hoiah angzo han koi pahlongkung, Angraeng Jesu Kri to a zing o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />hmuennawk boih angmah tlim ah suekthaihaih tha a tawnh baktih toengah, to tiah a suekthaihaih tha patohhaih rang hoiah, anih mah panuet kaom aicae ih takpum doeh a lensawkhaih takpum ah angcoengsak tih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To pongah kang palung o ih, kang dawn o parai ih nawkamyanawk, kang hoehaih hoi sui lumuek ah kaom kaminawk, kang palung o ih kaminawk, Angraeng ah kacakah angdoe oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Euodia hoi Syntykhe hnik, Angraeng ah poekhaih maeto tawnh hoi hanah tahmenhaih ka hnik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tok nawnto sah ampui nang doeh, tahmenhaih kang hnik, kai hoi nawnto kahoih tamthanglok taphong ampuinawk, Klement hoi kalah kai hoi nawnto toksah ampuinawk to abom oh, nihcae ih ahmin loe hinghaih cabu thungah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Angraeng ah anghoe o poe ah: kang thuih o let han vop, Anghoe oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangcae ih tuinom to kami boih mah panoek o nasoe. Angraeng loe kangthla ah om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kaw baktih hmuen pongah doeh mawnhaih tawn o hmah; hmuen boih nuiah lawkthui oh, minawk taham lawkthuihaih hoi kawnhaih lawkthuih hoiah hnik na koeh o ih hmuennawk to Sithaw khaeah hni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />To tiah na sak o nahaeloe, Kri Jesu rang hoiah mi mah doeh panoek thai ai ih, Sithaw monghaih mah, na poek o haih palungthin to uk tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, hnukkhuem koekah loktang hmuennawk boih, pakoeh koi kaom hmuennawk boih, katoeng hmuennawk boih, ciimcai hmuennawk boih, koeh kaom hmuennawk boih, kahoih ah thuih ih hmuennawk boih to palung thungah pakuem oh; kahoih hmuen ah oh moe, pakoeh koi kaom hmuen ah om nahaeloe, to baktih hmuennawk to poek ai ah om o hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kai khae hoi nam tuk o, na lak o, na thaih o moe, na hnuk o ih hmuennawk to sah oh; to tiah na sak o nahaeloe, monghaih Sithaw nangcae hoi nawnto om tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hnukkhuem koekah kai khetzawn koehhaih palungthin na tawnh o let pongah, Angraeng ah kating ai anghoehaih ka tawnh; to tiah khetzawn koehhaih palungthin na tawnh o, toe na khenzawn o thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kam tang pongah hae tiah lok ka thui ai, kawbaktih angdoethaih ahmuen ah kang doet cadoeh, kai loe ka tawnh ih hmuen hoi karaem ah khosak thaihaih to kam tuk boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kamtang baktiah khosakhaih to ka panoek, angraeng baktiah khosakhaih doeh ka panoek: zok amhahhaih, zok amthlamhaih, angraenghaih, amtanghaihnawk ka pauep thai hanah, kawbaktih ahmuen amae ah ka oh cadoeh, khosak thaihaih to kam tuk boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kai thacaksakkung, Kri rang hoiah hmuennawk boih ka sak thaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toe raihaih ka tongh naah kai nang bomh o, to tiah kahoih hmuen to na sak o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Macedonia hoi ka caeh moe, kahoih tamthanglok ka thuih tangsuek naah, kawbaktih kricaabu mah doeh kai han hmuenpaekhaih hoi talawkhaih to sah o ai, nangcae mah khue ni na sak o, tito nangcae Philipi kaminawk mah na panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thessalonika ah ka oh naah, kang toeng ih hmuenmae abomhaih vaito nang pat o pacoengah, nang pat o let bae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tangqum ka koeh pongah na ai ni: nangcae atho ohhaih to ni ka khet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toe hmuen boih ka tawnh: ka tawnh mangh, Epaphrodita khaeah nang pat o ih tangqumnawk to vaihi ka hnuk boeh, hmuihoih tangqum loe, angbawnhaih sak naah talawk thai koiah kaom, Sithaw palung tongsak thaih hmuen ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toe a lensawkhaih hoi angmah ih angraenghaih baktih toengah, Kri Jesu rang hoiah Sithaw mah nangcae angaihaih to koepsak boih tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sithaw hoi aicae Ampa khaeah dungzan hoi dungzan khoek to lensawkhaih om poe nasoe. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kri Jesu ah kaciim kaminawk boih to ban sin oh. Kai khaeah kaom nawkamyanawk mah ban ang sin o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kaciim kaminawk boih mah ban ang sin o, lokpui koekah Caesar ih imthung takoh mah ban ang sin o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri tahmenhaih nangcae boih khaeah om nasoe. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
